rage… The best part is, you can relocate your territory any time you want! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/45c03fae8ce89d9cb0e2e487eb85ccc4.poster.avif?t=1786675226\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/45c03fae8ce89d9cb0e2e487eb85ccc4.webm?t=1786675226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/45c03fae8ce89d9cb0e2e487eb85ccc4.mp4?t=1786675226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find out the truth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the truth of Stardust, find out where it came from, and what it wants. In the journey of seeking truth, you may feel alone, but you are never alone. There are several factions in the world, some can be violent and hostile, others might be friendly and helpful. Explore human settlements to learn their stories or exterminate bosses without leaving a name for survivors to praise, the choices are yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/6a93a33aceaa3696addb891058fae574.poster.avif?t=1786675226\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/6a93a33aceaa3696addb891058fae574.webm?t=1786675226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/extras/6a93a33aceaa3696addb891058fae574.mp4?t=1786675226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Once Human is a Strange Worlds Survival Game set in a strange, post-apocalyptic future. Unite with friends to fight monstrous enemies, uncover secret plots, compete for resources, and build your own territory. Once, you were merely human. Now, you have the power to remake the world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/c18b08a2f93dec32fcc5fa71bc2da44ee42de1f0/header.jpg?t=1786675226", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/71f8ca678f3eb4f9ac609603cefc02216cabcdb1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786675226", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139460/71f8ca678f3eb4f9ac609603cefc02216cabcdb1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786675226", "website": "https://t.co/gRX2BR4tj9", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit Operating System<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / Snapdragon® X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 750ti 4G / AMD Radeon RX550 / Qualcomm® Adreno X1 GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD is highly recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit Operating System<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700 / Snapdragon® X2 Elite<br></li><li><strong